# Tekko PYUSD (phase 1 + dashboard wiring)

## Product locks

- Collect: one-time **PYUSD** on **Ethereum** only.
- Settle: merchant **PYUSD-USDC** ledger (display **PYUSD USDC**). Do **not** credit Europe `USDC`. No merchant PYUSD/PYUSD-USDC withdraw in this phase.
- Credit PYUSD-USDC only when Tekko `settlementStatus === settled` (or verified settle via poll/reconcile). Do **not** credit on unpaid `customer.wallet.credited` alone. Dedupe via webhook claim + `pending` update + ledger reference check.
- EUR payout / Europe CPG spend **USDC** only. PYUSD-USDC cannot fund Tylt.
- Tekko has **no sandbox**: real calls are **live-only**; `test` fails closed (`payment_unavailable`).
- Isolation: do **not** edit `services/integrations/tylt/**` or `services/domestic/**` PayOK for Tekko work (may import shared helpers like wallet get-or-create).

